flowchart TD
  ms[Manuscript<br/>PDF · TeX · Markdown] --> est[estimate<br/>page count × topology<br/>no model call]
  est --> ok{Confirm cost<br/>and depth?}
  ok -->|yes| run[review<br/>segmented passes over the whole paper]
  run --> engine[vendor/open-deepreview<br/>Node engine, no Bun]
  engine -->|loopback bridge<br/>OpenAI-compatible| llm[Host LLM service<br/>= the session model]
  run --> peer[scholar-peer pass<br/>summary · strengths/weaknesses<br/>claim-evidence map · 9-item checklist<br/>questions for the authors]
  run --> refs[reference verification<br/>OpenAlex + Crossref]
  run --> art[Artifacts<br/>.dsh/deep-review/&lt;key&gt;/<br/>review.json · review.md · paper.md<br/>pdf-meta.json · citations.json<br/>estimate.json · meta.json · runs.jsonl]
  art --> show[show<br/>summary · comments · questions<br/>checklist · claims · citations]
  show --> revise[Revise the manuscript]
  revise --> stale[status<br/>content hash changed → stale]
  stale -.->|re-run| est
  art -.-> prov[provenance_audit<br/>indexes stored claims by id and hash]
  art -.-> report[notes/ and deepreview_report_vN.md]

  classDef input fill:#eef2ff,stroke:#6366f1,color:#312e81
  classDef gate fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#f97316,color:#7c2d12
  classDef core fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
  classDef store fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#94a3b8,color:#0f172a
  class ms input
  class ok,stale gate
  class est,run,engine,llm,peer,refs,show,revise core
  class art,prov,report store
